{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Fail closed for unclassified filesystem errors.** This fallback still marks every unlisted `IOException` retryable, including permanent quota, capacity, and provider failures. `DurableExecutor` then requests invocation retries indefinitely, potentially rerunning at-least-once work. Default unknown I/O failures to `PayloadOffloadException` and explicitly whitelist known transient cases; add quota/ENOSPC coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okM-p","finding_digest":"98b71c294789015c1553b52c9edf7519c59d9cc6c7bd08e85a7caf533b7da311","finding_id":"arf_v1_tc3rykkhreavyfktwuwj5x3vdh","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::load::permanent-io-retry-classification","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::load::permanent-io-retry-classification","line":365,"observation_digest":"c4d65b9d898c63e3eae1431da8e5864c5b7eb009be74095cc93e95db659c58b3","observation_id":"aro_v1_ytlfxhmjrrr6h2xbimo2rzmgjr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/FileSystemPayloadOffloader.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_tc3rykkhreavyfktwuwj5x3vdh","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bnkytan6qbz2kkbfo5ofv5teg6","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e9f3957eec87467c5d8566ed014a6e592000f653","reviewer":"codex","start_line":365,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_jrydnmxtksxciu62jvkzwwwctr","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
